Nothing suspicious in the compiled HLO as far as I can tell; I suspect this is an XLA issue.
The result of each multiplication is an odd number just a hair larger than $2^{24}$ and therefore not representable in float32, but it's strange that the difference in rounded values is affected by JIT.
